                <invention-title lang="de">LACKIERPISTOLE MIT VERBESSERTER DÜSE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PISTOLET DE PEINTURE MUNI D'UNE BUSE AMÉLIORÉE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">PAINTING GUN PROVIDED WITH AN IMPROVED NOZZLE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Nozzle (10) for a painting gun (3), the nozzle (10) comprising a tubular hollow body extending along a longitudinal axis (A), the hollow body defining an inner space (10e) comprising:• a coupling portion (10a) connectable to a body (4) of the painting gun (3),• an end portion (10b) defining an opening (8) fluidically connected to said inner space (10e), the inner space (10e) being fluidly connectable to a painting fluid source of the painting gun (3), and• a plurality of cantilevered portions (10c) located between the coupling portion (10a) and the end portion (10b), the cantilevered portions (10c) being spaced apart by lobed openings (13), the lobed openings being fluidically connectable to a pressurized air source of the gun (3) to allow a flow of pressurized air to reach the opening (8) from outside the inner space (10e).</p>
            </abstract>
